      <p>
        Finding out a home has an underground heating oil tank can sound intimidating, but it shouldn't derail your transaction. Buried fuel tanks are extremely common across King and Snohomish counties in homes built before 1985. With a simple tank sweep, clean decommissioning records, and Washington's PLIA grant program, managing a tank is straightforward once you know the playbook.
      </p>
